        "title": "Mitigation and adaptation",
        "layout": "stack",
        "align": "left",
        "blocks": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "body": "There are two ways to respond to climate change. **Mitigation** means tackling the causes, so the climate changes less. **Adaptation** means adjusting to the changes that are already happening."
